Практикум 1. Gini Impurity	Реализуйте Gini Impurity. Упражнение по мотивам ISLR, гл. 8 и документации scikit-learn.	Читайте stdin, печатайте только ответ.	\N	CODE	{"_meta": {"sources": ["https://www.statlearning.com/ · https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/tree.html"], "ai_generated": false}, "test_cases": [{"id": "tc_c2acc56e21df4e2486c928e03df8cdb1", "label": "Пример 1", "stdin": "4\\n0 0 1 1\\n", "hidden": false, "weight": 1, "expectedStdout": "0.500000"}, {"id": "tc_64a57881e66a4f8a8dbb091632328a7c", "label": "Пример 2", "stdin": "5\\n1 1 1 1 1\\n", "hidden": true, "weight": 1, "expectedStdout": "0.000000"}, {"id": "tc_c63e06411d774aa2be419273e3c369eb", "label": "Пример 3", "stdin": "6\\n0 0 0 1 1 1\\n", "hidden": true, "weight": 1, "expectedStdout": "0.500000"}, {"id": "tc_493c10c963394d75880839855b71969a", "label": "Пример 4", "stdin": "3\\n0 1 2\\n", "hidden": true, "weight": 1, "expectedStdout": "0.666667"}], "language_id": 71, "grading_mode": "equal_weight", "starter_code": "import sys\\n\\ndef gini(labels):\\n    return 0.0\\n\\ndata=sys.stdin.read().split()\\nif data:\\n    n=int(data[0]); labels=list(map(int,data[1:1+n])); print(f'{gini(labels):.6f}')\\n", "solution_code": "import sys\\nfrom collections import Counter\\ndef gini(labels):\\n    if not labels: return 0.0\\n    n=len(labels); return 1.0-sum((c/n)**2 for c in Counter(labels).values())\\ndata=sys.stdin.read().split()\\nif data:\\n    n=int(data[0]); labels=list(map(int,data[1:1+n])); print(f'{gini(labels):.6f}')\\n", "allow_student_run": true, "show_hidden_test_count": true, "require_passing_to_submit": true, "show_test_details_on_fail": true, "show_solution_after_submit": false, "explanation_weight": 30}	100	894	task_9f809de22b4f432ba458f7f28ce59c52	0	2026-11-10 19:21:33.153860	2026-11-10 19:21:33.153869	894	1	6	44	985	\N	\N
Практикум 2. Information Gain	Реализуйте энтропию и информационный выигрыш для порога. Упражнение по мотивам ISLR и STAT 508.	Читайте stdin, печатайте только ответ.	\N	CODE	{"_meta": {"sources": ["https://online.stat.psu.edu/stat508/ · https://www.statlearning.com/"], "ai_generated": false}, "test_cases": [{"id": "tc_71ca99d9a6a64b70a50470db42b18861", "label": "Пример 1", "stdin": "4\\n0 0 1 1\\n4\\n1 2 3 4\\n2.5\\n", "hidden": false, "weight": 1, "expectedStdout": "1.000000 0.000000 1.000000"}, {"id": "tc_18ebb695709e441994e0a0e36cbcbe7a", "label": "Пример 2", "stdin": "4\\n0 1 0 1\\n4\\n1 2 3 4\\n2.5\\n", "hidden": true, "weight": 1, "expectedStdout": "1.000000 1.000000 0.000000"}, {"id": "tc_34211c39b612421188bc96e42caac039", "label": "Пример 3", "stdin": "5\\n0 0 0 1 1\\n5\\n1 2 3 4 5\\n2.5\\n", "hidden": true, "weight": 1, "expectedStdout": "0.970951 0.550978 0.419973"}], "language_id": 71, "grading_mode": "equal_weight", "starter_code": "import sys\\nfrom math import log2\\n\\ndef entropy(labels):\\n    return 0.0\\n\\ndata=sys.stdin.read().split()\\nif data:\\n    n=int(data[0]); labels=list(map(int,data[1:1+n])); m=int(data[1+n]); values=list(map(float,data[2+n:2+n+m])); t=float(data[2+n+m])\\n    l=[labels[i] for i in range(n) if values[i]<=t]; r=[labels[i] for i in range(n) if values[i]>t]\\n    hp=entropy(labels); hc=max(0.0,(len(l)*entropy(l)+len(r)*entropy(r))/n); print(f'{hp:.6f} {hc:.6f} {max(0.0,hp-hc):.6f}')\\n", "solution_code": "import sys\\nfrom math import log2\\nfrom collections import Counter\\ndef entropy(labels):\\n    if not labels: return 0.0\\n    n=len(labels); return -sum((c/n)*log2(c/n) for c in Counter(labels).values())\\ndata=sys.stdin.read().split()\\nif data:\\n    n=int(data[0]); labels=list(map(int,data[1:1+n])); m=int(data[1+n]); values=list(map(float,data[2+n:2+n+m])); t=float(data[2+n+m])\\n    l=[labels[i] for i in range(n) if values[i]<=t]; r=[labels[i] for i in range(n) if values[i]>t]\\n    hp=entropy(labels); hc=max(0.0,(